ji,,0,0,0,karaoke,立｜たち止｜どまらないさ　ほら、前｜ま#｜えに大｜たい切｜!せ#｜つな君｜き#｜みが　待｜まってるComment: 0,0:01:06.23,0:01:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:01:09.57,0:01:18.18,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Look up ahead, my treasure, as you are waiting there for me!Comment: 0,0:01:21.72,0:01:31.13,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,As we've set off on our long journey, with love courage friendship andComment: 0,0:01:32.83,0:01:43.54,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,a bit of playfullness, as these are things that will remain in our hearts forever.Comment: 0,0:01:45.93,0:01:51.71,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,We're on an adventure to find that someone.Comment: 0,0:01:52.07,0:02:02.68,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,We'll never stop! Look up ahead, my treasure, as you are waiting there for me!Comment: 0,0:02:04.21,0:02:08.87,Translation Dark,,0,0,0,karaoke,With ever tear we shed, we grow stronger;Comment: 0,0:02:10.35,0:02:13.14,Translation Dark,,0,0,0,karaoke,and with every tear, our memories...Comment: 0,0:02:13.14,0:02:23.83,Translation Dark,,0,0,0,karaoke,grow, grow and grow much stronger! (Yeah!)Comment: 0,0:02:14.02,0:02:23.83,Translation Green,,0,0,0,karaoke,grow, grow and grow much stronger! (Yeah!)Comment: 0,0:02:15.02,0:02:23.83,Translation Yellow,,0,0,0,karaoke,grow, grow and grow much stronger! (Yeah!)Comment: 0,0:02:16.02,0:02:23.83,Translation Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,grow, grow and grow much stronger! (Yeah!)Comment: 0,0:02:17.03,0:02:23.83,Translation White,,0,0,0,karaoke,grow, grow and grow much stronger! (Yeah!)Comment: 0,0:02:18.11,0:02:23.83,Translation Dark - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,grow, grow and grow much stronger! (Yeah!)Comment: 0,0:02:24.02,0:02:29.66,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,So when you feel the wind, you gotta feel it blowing!Comment: 0,0:02:30.05,0:02:35.80,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Let's go search for the wind that dries up our tears!Comment: 0,0:02:36.07,0:02:41.73,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,We're on an adventure to find that someone.Comment: 0,0:02:42.21,0:02:54.15,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,We'll never stop! Look up ahead, my treasure, as you are waiting there for me!Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:08.88,Captions,,0,0,230,,Grand Line Momoiro Island (Kamabakka Kingdom)Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.78,0:00:13.78,Main,,0,0,0,,What is this place?Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.78,0:00:15.49,Main,,0,0,0,,And more importantly...Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.37,0:00:18.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What is with these guys!?Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:36.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it...Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:45.06,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Dear Nami-san, Robin-chan...Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:47.09,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Are you doing well?Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.09,0:00:50.36,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see you again.Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:56.57,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,When I do, I'm sure we'll become great friends.Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:15.98,Title,,0,0,580,,The Underwater PrisonDialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:15.98,Title,,0,0,150,,Impel DownDialogue: 0,0:03:20.27,0:03:25.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanted you and Luffy to become great marines...Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:32.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Nevermind marines, you two brothers have become notorious outlaws.Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.10,0:03:35.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've heard the rumors about Luffy, too.Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.75,0:03:39.58,Main,,0,0,0,,In Water 7, he picked a fight with the World Government...Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:43.75,Main,,0,0,0,,and somehow managed to invade the Judicial Island, Enies Lobby.Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.87,0:03:54.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. I also told Luffy about his father.Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.31,0:04:01.37,Main,,0,0,0,,He was really surprised to hear he had a father.Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.20,0:04:04.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter...Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.05,0:04:06.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Whether we know about it or not...Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.11,0:04:07.95,Main,,0,0,0,,as annoying as it is,Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.95,0:04:12.48,Main,,0,0,0,,both me and Luffy carry the blood of a world-renowned criminal.Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.48,0:04:15.65,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way we could have ever been marines.Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:21.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though I owe my mother a debt of gratitude and took the name "Portgas"...Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.32,0:04:25.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I still can't stand the thought that I carry the blood of that worthless father of mine.Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.81,0:04:29.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't remember him at all, and I don't owe him anything.Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.89,0:04:34.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get what you mean, but he was just...Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.40,0:04:34.96,Secondary,,0,0,0,,That's why...Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:39.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Gramps...Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.11,0:04:45.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd hate to see you die right now, kid.Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:54.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Take my name and roam wild and free over the seas!Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.35,0:04:56.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Become my son!Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:03.94,Main,,0,0,0,,My old man is...Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.74,0:05:08.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard, and no one else.Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.33,0:05:19.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Momonga!Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.48,0:05:21.01,Main,,0,0,0,,We've spotted a pirate ship.Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.01,0:05:22.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Whose ship is it?Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.93,0:05:26.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I know I've seen that mark before...Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:27.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go look into it right away!Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.77,0:05:29.97,Main,,0,0,0,,If you can't remember it offhand,Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:32.31,Main,,0,0,0,,then it can't be anyone important.Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.31,0:05:33.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Just ignore it.Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.82,0:05:36.71,Main,,0,0,0,,We must get to our destination quickly.Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:37.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Yessir!Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.69,0:05:44.24,Main,,0,0,0,,There's one! A giant Sea-King!Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:48.62,Main,,0,0,0,,If that thing spots us, it'll swallow the ship whole!Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.30,0:05:52.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Please don't look this way...Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.35,0:05:56.13,Main,,0,0,0,,It's gone.Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.13,0:05:59.59,Main,,0,0,0,,W-We've gotten this far...Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.59,0:06:02.53,Main,,0,0,0,,but I don't know what good we can do if we continue!Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.53,0:06:07.60,Main,,0,0,0,,What should we do now, Big Sis Alvida?Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.39,0:06:10.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me.Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.39,0:06:14.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You were the ones who wanted to come here, right?Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.21,0:06:17.57,Main,,0,0,0,,You spent so much money on that Eternal Pose, too.Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.57,0:06:24.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, we have to save Captain Buggy, who was taken to Impel Down!Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.23,0:06:28.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Take a look at the sea.Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:30.93,Main,,0,0,0,,The Calm Belt lies just beyond here.Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.93,0:06:32.67,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the monsters' nest.Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:35.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you really think we can make it through with this ship?Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.59,0:06:41.26,Main,,0,0,0,,The only other route would be to go there on a Navy ship.Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:45.97,Main,,0,0,0,,The Gates of Justice won't open for a pirate ship, after all.Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:49.36,Main,,0,0,0,,No way! You mean we can't even get there?Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:53.47,Main,,0,0,0,,At this rate, Captain Buggy will be put to death!Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.47,0:06:57.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Along with our new buddy, Ace-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.53,0:07:06.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Impel Down is the world's largest prison, which can neither be broken into nor escaped from.Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.13,0:07:10.37,Main,,0,0,0,,You should just give up already.Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.37,0:07:14.17,Main,,0,0,0,,This just means that Buggy the Clown's luck as a pirate has run out.Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.07,0:07:17.03,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not true!Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.03,0:07:21.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy wouldn't bite the dust from something like this!Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.43,0:07:24.72,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right! We've sworn to keep following Captain Buggy...Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:28.10,Main,,0,0,0,,until the day when we finally find what we've been looking for:Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.10,0:07:31.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain John's treasure island!Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.44,0:07:37.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Richie!Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:39.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Do whatever you want, then.Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.77,0:07:43.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take the Big Top, here.Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.72,0:07:45.99,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys can set off in a rowboat.Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.14,0:07:50.41,Main,,0,0,0,,No way! This is Captain Buggy's ship!Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.79,0:07:54.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Buggy isn't here, is he?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.17,0:07:56.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You're right...Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.63,0:08:01.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I know if we go there, we'll all die, so I'm not going.Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.65,0:08:03.71,Main,,0,0,0,,It'd be a waste to bring the ship there, too.Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.36,0:08:09.30,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys can just chase after Buggy in a rowboat until you're satisfied.Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.05,0:08:12.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.27,0:08:16.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, you'll probably die long before you even see Impel Down.Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:24.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy! Thank you so much for everything!Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.03,0:08:27.66,Main,,0,0,0,,We will never forget what you have done for us!Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.41,0:08:31.39,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll pray that your execution be quick and painless!Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.39,0:08:32.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Farewell!Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.87,0:08:35.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's meet again in the next life!Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.88,0:08:41.23,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Momonga.Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.23,0:08:44.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Marine code G-1 00660.Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.13,0:08:46.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I will enter the current shortly.Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:47.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Prepare to open the gates!Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:58.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,Enies LobbyDialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:58.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,Navy Headquarters (Marineford)Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:58.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,MariejoisDialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:58.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sabaody ArchipelagoDialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:58.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Great Prison Impel DownDialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:58.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,Current locationDialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:58.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,Amazon LilyDialogue: 0,0:08:48.97,0:08:51.35,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The ship carrying Luffy and Hancock...Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.35,0:08:54.35,Narrator,,0,0,0,,is about to enter the current connecting the three main facilities...Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.35,0:08:55.84,Narrator,,0,0,0,,of the World Government...Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.84,0:08:58.52,Narrator,,0,0,0,,the Tarai Current, which can only be used by the Navy.Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.94,0:09:04.90,Captions,,0,0,240,,Great Underwater PrisonDialogue: 0,0:08:58.94,0:09:04.90,Captions,,0,0,0,,Impel DownDialogue: 0,0:09:20.75,0:09:22.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, kill me!Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.17,0:09:27.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Newbie!Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:29.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you just sitting there,Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:33.55,Main,,0,0,0,,munching away at your bread without first greeting the boss of this cell?Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.77,0:09:40.42,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a rule around here that newbies are supposed to offer their food to the boss!Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.57,0:09:52.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Learned your lesson yet?Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.85,0:10:17.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.34,0:10:19.38,Main,,0,0,0,,We were just having a small fight!Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.38,0:10:21.72,Main,,0,0,0,,We ain't on death row!Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:22.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Let us out!Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.10,0:10:55.11,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Four and a half days have passed...Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.11,0:10:58.47,Narrator,,0,0,0,,since the departure from  the Island of Women, Amazon Lily.Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:03.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Momonga!Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.90,0:11:07.09,Main,,0,0,0,,The headwind slowed us down a little,Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.09,0:11:09.83,Main,,0,0,0,,but we've finally reached Impel Down!Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:13.90,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad... We have to hurry.Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:15.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Get Hancock, now!Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.97,0:11:16.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Yessir!Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.95,0:11:19.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Hancock-dono! We have arrived!Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.62,0:11:20.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I will be there shortly.Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:22.40,Main,,0,0,0,,What's this?Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.40,0:11:25.04,Main,,0,0,0,,There are more warships here than there were in the Buster Call!Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.83,0:11:29.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Currently, this is the most dangerous place in the world.Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.50,0:11:31.60,Main,,0,0,0,,It is obvious that it would be well-guarded.Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.63,0:11:35.34,Main,,0,0,0,,So, Ace is inside here?Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:38.95,Main,,0,0,0,,He is probably far below the surface.Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.95,0:11:41.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, hide under my clothes.Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.13,0:11:49.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Vice Admiral Momonga!Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.46,0:11:59.03,Main,,0,0,0,,L-Look at that!Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:01.05,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the Pirate Empress!Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:02.79,Main,,0,0,0,,She's more beautiful than anyone else!Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.79,0:12:05.33,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no limit to her beauty!Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:09.99,Main,,0,0,0,,How high can her Beauty Power rise? Ten thousand watts? A million?Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.65,0:12:13.86,Main,,0,0,0,,What is all the fuss about?Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.86,0:12:15.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Such a noisy bunch.Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.81,0:12:17.29,Main,,0,0,0,,May I petrify them?Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:20.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Please don't.Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.05,0:12:24.13,Main,,0,0,0,,The Navy doesn't need any more humiliation.Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.72,0:12:28.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Your condition for helping us was that you wanted to see the man at the center of these events,Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:31.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Portgas D. Ace, for yourself, right?Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.77,0:12:33.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you before,Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.33,0:12:37.32,Main,,0,0,0,,but this place is usually strictly off-limits for pirates, even the Seven Warlords of the Sea.Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.53,0:12:40.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Once you enter,Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.51,0:12:42.97,Main,,0,0,0,,you will be restrained with Seastone shackles.Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:47.66,Main,,0,0,0,,You will also have to go through a full body check at the entrance.Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:53.73,Main,,0,0,0,,We cannot let you free any of the inmates or anything, after all.Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.14,0:12:58.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy. They will do a body check once we enter.Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.09,0:13:00.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll figure something out. Just keep going!Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.78,0:13:04.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I do not mind.Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:06.36,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:07.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Buggy the Clown?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.80,0:13:09.35,Main,,0,0,0,,He's escaped from his cell?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.35,0:13:10.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he a Devil Fruit User?Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.45,0:13:13.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Assistant Warden.Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.78,0:13:18.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Momonga and the Warlord Hancock-dono have arrived.Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.23,0:13:20.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Right. I'll be there in a minute.Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.70,0:13:25.36,Main,,0,0,0,,She's so cu...uh...open the gates!Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.36,0:13:28.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Give her whatever service she wants!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.79,0:13:34.33,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Time left until Ace's execution...Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.33,0:13:37.67,Narrator,,0,0,0,,33 hours.Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.66,0:13:42.46,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Here we go, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.71,0:13:48.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Do take care!Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.27,0:13:52.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Hancock-sama! Have a safe trip!Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.39,0:13:53.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop your buzzing, little flies!Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.81,0:13:57.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be cruel! Take care, now!Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.24,0:14:05.62,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Help us!Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.62,0:14:07.70,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Help!Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:10.37,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What an oppressive atmosphere.Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.37,0:14:12.92,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Is this what hell is like?Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.63,0:14:15.30,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,We have finally made it inside.Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:17.88,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,We cannot relax yet, however.Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.47,0:14:24.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I welcome you to my Impel Down!Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.34,0:14:26.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah! My mistake!Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.32,0:14:29.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Calling it "my" Impel Down is too ambitious!Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.41,0:14:32.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I am still but the assistant warden, Hannyabal!Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.61,0:14:35.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Pleasure to meet you!Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.68,0:14:36.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Momonga.Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.90,0:14:38.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I've heard what you're here for.Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:42.17,Main,,0,0,0,,And you must be the Empress, Hancock-dono?Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.17,0:14:45.32,Main,,0,0,0,,My Empress, Hancock-dono?Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:46.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, forgive me!Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:48.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm being too ambitious again!Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.37,0:14:50.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That stinking warden...Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:52.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! My mistake.Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.08,0:14:57.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Warden Magellan is in his office down in Level 4.Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.27,0:14:59.62,Main,,0,0,0,,You will be taken there right now.Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.62,0:15:04.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Your escorts will be Vice Chief Jailer Domino here, and myself.Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.55,0:15:07.67,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems you are short on time, so please, come this way.Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:12.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral, you go over there and undergo your body check.Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:19.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Our prisoners are all sent into this cage where they are stripped of their clothes...Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.73,0:15:24.79,Main,,0,0,0,,...and lowered into pots of boiling water. We call this process the "Lukewarm Bath of Hell".Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.79,0:15:29.33,Main,,0,0,0,,We use it to "disinfect" and baptize our prisoners, before they are put in their cells.Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.04,0:15:33.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Even among those prisoners, there are some who are tougher than others.Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.02,0:15:37.08,Main,,0,0,0,,A few of our recent inmates, Fire Fist Ace...Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.91,0:15:40.50,Main,,0,0,0,,as well as the Warlord Jinbe, and...Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:43.59,Main,,0,0,0,,the former Warlord, Crocodile...Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.59,0:15:48.60,Main,,0,0,0,,...all went through the baptism without even batting an eyelash.Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:54.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Here you are.Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.70,0:15:57.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Guests check in inside this private room.Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.06,0:15:58.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.02,0:16:09.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Please remove that cloak.Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.67,0:16:12.53,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the easiest way to conceal someone,Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.53,0:16:14.46,Main,,0,0,0,,so please hand it over to me.Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.03,0:16:17.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I have no reason to suspect you,Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.55,0:16:20.15,Main,,0,0,0,,but if you were thinking of pulling anything suspicious,Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.71,0:16:26.05,Main,,0,0,0,,we have monitoring Transponder Snails all over Impel Down.Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.05,0:16:29.97,Main,,0,0,0,,They transmit everything they see to the security monitors.Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.68,0:16:35.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then, first things first.Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.53,0:16:38.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Put on these Seastone shackles.Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:42.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I am not even a prisoner, yet I still need shackles...Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.63,0:16:44.49,Main,,0,0,0,,You are too cautious.Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.88,0:16:51.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, be gentle with me.Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.07,0:16:57.04,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:03.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You can come out now, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:08.22,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close!Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.71,0:17:13.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd have to make a break for it when they weren't watching...Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.18,0:17:16.06,Main,,0,0,0,,You can turn anything into stone, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.06,0:17:20.52,Main,,0,0,0,,This seems to be as far as I can take you.Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:24.31,Main,,0,0,0,,After this, my abilities will be restrained by Seastone.Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.31,0:17:26.86,Main,,0,0,0,,And you won't be able to hide once they've taken my cloak.Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.01,0:17:31.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I had hoped to be of more help to you...Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.21,0:17:32.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you saying?Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:36.41,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'd have made it all the way here by myself!Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.41,0:17:39.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You got me inside a building surrounded by warships.Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:41.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You've helped me plenty!Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.51,0:17:43.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.34,0:17:49.53,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a stronghold made to lock people away.Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.53,0:17:52.94,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, please do not cause an uproar here.Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:56.59,Main,,0,0,0,,If you get captured, you will never be able to get out.Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:04.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Though you are strong, will you promise me to not cause any disturbances?Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.69,0:18:08.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Right, I got it! I promise!Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.91,0:18:10.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Hancock!Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:13.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget what you did for me!Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.99,0:18:15.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll definitely repay you someday!Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.33,0:18:18.50,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Just now... you...Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.50,0:18:20.36,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,called me...Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:22.97,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Hancock?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.25,0:18:26.75,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sure thing, Hammock!Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.75,0:18:28.96,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hammock, I want more food!Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:31.05,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What's up, Hammock?Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.81,0:18:36.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Hancock!Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:49.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Now my life is complete!Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.70,0:18:53.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can turn them back now.Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.91,0:18:55.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine!Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:59.49,Main,,0,0,0,,This must be... a mutual affection!Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.49,0:19:01.16,Main,,0,0,0,,They sure are taking their time...Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:05.53,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a security check, so we have to be thorough about it.Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.34,0:19:09.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Even those parts...?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.09,0:19:12.22,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you imagining?Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.41,0:19:16.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Assistant Warden Hannyabal!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.01,0:19:19.79,Main,,0,0,0,,The surveillance Transponder Snail isn't transmitting anything...Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.79,0:19:21.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Is everything all right in there?Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.94,0:19:26.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Domino! Is something wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.35,0:19:35.32,Main,,0,0,0,,The body-check is complete.Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.73,0:19:40.29,Main,,0,0,0,,The surveillance is working again. No problems.Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.29,0:19:42.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry.Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.05,0:19:43.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Did that take too long?Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.41,0:19:46.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Not at all!Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:47.54,Main,,0,0,0,,No problems here either.Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.59,0:19:52.36,Main,,0,0,0,,What tasteless treatment of someone who isn't a prisoner...Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.36,0:19:54.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Just who do you think I am?Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.52,0:19:55.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Please tolerate it.Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.96,0:19:59.64,Main,,0,0,0,,It's one of the rules of Impel Down.Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:01.13,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This is strange...Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.13,0:20:03.39,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,My memory feels hazy...Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.39,0:20:05.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Please lead the way.Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.27,0:20:09.31,Main,,0,0,0,,As you wish. Head toward the mega-lift over there.Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.19,0:20:15.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Using this lift, we'll go down to the fourth undersea floor.Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.03,0:20:20.13,Main,,0,0,0,,That will take us to the Inferno, where Prison Warden Magellan's office is.Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.13,0:20:22.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I should warn you, it's pretty hot down there.Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.00,0:20:28.63,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.55,0:20:32.10,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I will pray for your fortune.Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.90,0:20:35.76,Note,,0,0,0,,(Thank you!)Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.31,0:20:39.47,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He said "I love you"!Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.18,0:20:42.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.14,0:20:44.62,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hancock-dono! What's wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.62,0:20:45.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Be careful with her.Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:48.10,Main,,0,0,0,,What's this all of a sudden?Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.21,0:20:58.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, now where do I go?Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.65,0:21:01.57,Main,,0,0,0,,That lift is going down,Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.57,0:21:05.32,Main,,0,0,0,,and Hancock said Ace was probably at the bottom of the sea...Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.32,0:21:06.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That's it!Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.65,0:21:08.54,Main,,0,0,0,,This is what I've got the Vivre Card for.Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:33.19,Main,,0,0,0,,The Blugori jailers are coming back.Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:35.08,Main,,0,0,0,,They've secured food.Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.08,0:21:36.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Open the hatches.Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:41.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Good job.Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.71,0:21:43.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Carry the meat to the freezers.Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.25,0:21:48.91,Main,,0,0,0,,We've found him!Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.91,0:21:52.83,Main,,0,0,0,,The escaped pirate from Shared Cell 4 in Level 1, Buggy the Clown!Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.83,0:21:55.30,Main,,0,0,0,,We've confirmed that he's standing in the hall by Isolation Cell 22!Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.30,0:21:57.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Capture him immediately!Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.08,0:21:59.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn, they found me, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.22,0:22:01.43,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.25,0:22:07.52,Main,,0,0,0,,We've lost contact with  surveillance Transponder Snail #71!Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.52,0:22:09.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that? It's Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.56,0:22:13.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Serves him right for trying to escape on his own!Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.54,0:22:16.23,Main,,0,0,0,,He's got a horrible punishment waiting for him!Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.24,0:22:20.99,Main,,0,0,0,,There they are! The Blugori!Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.99,0:22:22.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Go!Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.41,0:22:23.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Go get him!Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.71,0:22:32.37,Main,,0,0,0,,The Vivre Card is telling me to go down here, but...Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.37,0:22:34.57,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a dead end, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.57,0:22:42.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Prisoner number 8200.Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.05,0:22:44.01,Main,,0,0,0,,What? We're not letting him get away!Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:47.91,Main,,0,0,0,,They've verified him as a Devil Fruit user!Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.91,0:22:49.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't forget the Seastone!Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.77,0:22:52.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.19,0:22:54.91,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll split up and surround him!Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.69,0:22:59.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Right! I'm in!Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.90,0:23:01.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.81,0:23:04.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that?Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.19,0:23:08.56,Captions,,0,0,170,,Level 1 - Crimson FloorDialogue: 0,0:23:10.42,0:23:12.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Are all these rooms prison cells?Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.94,0:23:15.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Screams?Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.97,0:23:18.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever. Anyway, I've gotta keep going!Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.71,0:23:22.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey!Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.71,0:23:23.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.80,0:23:25.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Bro! Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.68,0:23:26.55,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.55,0:23:28.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.07,0:23:30.36,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you doing outside the cage?Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.36,0:23:31.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's up?Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.98,0:23:35.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Outside the cage? I came from the outside...Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.31,0:23:36.22,Main,,0,0,0,,See ya!Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.22,0:23:39.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't lie, dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.06,0:23:40.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I ain't lying!Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.79,0:23:42.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you?Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.29,0:23:44.81,Main,,0,0,0,,You're not a jailer or a torturer, are you?Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.81,0:23:47.66,Main,,0,0,0,,How come you're outside the cage?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:50.49,Main,,0,0,0,,You sure are noisy!Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.49,0:23:52.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! Do you guys know where Ace is?Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.66,0:23:54.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace?Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.49,0:23:57.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace... you mean...Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.99,0:24:00.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire Fist Ace?Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.96,0:24:03.67,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. I wanna save Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.80,0:24:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be so reckless!Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.47,0:24:10.18,Main,,0,0,0,,True, I did hear that he'd been sent here...Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.18,0:24:13.45,Main,,0,0,0,,If he is, then he's probably down in Level 5!Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.45,0:24:15.16,Main,,0,0,0,,No way you'd be able to get near that place.Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.16,0:24:15.98,Main,,0,0,0,,It's impossible!Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.98,0:24:21.24,Main,,0,0,0,,That's where they keep the guys with bounties over a 100 million, ya know!Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.44,0:24:24.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Level 5?Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.24,0:24:25.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Bro.Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.68,0:24:29.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Mind going to the jailers' room and stealing the keys?Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.34,0:24:32.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Please, Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.66,0:24:39.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that it must have been fate that we met here, in this huge world?Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.68,0:24:45.13,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that?Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.72,0:24:47.05,Main,,0,0,0,,The Blugori!Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.05,0:24:48.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Blugori?Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.27,0:24:49.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Run away, Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.58,0:24:50.68,Main,,0,0,0,,They'll kill ya!Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.86,0:25:02.82,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with these guys?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.82,0:25:05.28,Main,,0,0,0,,To the right!Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.28,0:25:07.45,Main,,0,0,0,,To the left!Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.41,0:25:13.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Fools!Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.03,0:25:15.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't look down on the man with the power of the Split-Split Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.76,0:25:21.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.58,0:25:23.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.60,0:25:27.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh. Buggy, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.50,0:25:30.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Why you... don't screw with me, you lowlife!Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.97,0:25:33.22,Main,,0,0,0,,You're as cheeky as ever, I see!Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.22,0:25:36.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were captured, too!Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.56,0:25:39.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I came here on my own!Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.13,0:25:40.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I wasn't captured!Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.65,0:25:44.48,Main,,0,0,0,,What sort of idiot would willingly enter a prison?Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.32,0:25:49.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, could it be that you heard of my imprisonment...Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.07,0:25:51.94,Main,,0,0,0,,and came to rescue me?Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.94,0:25:53.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Like hell!Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.49,0:25:56.49,Main,,0,0,0,,–Dumbass! I'm getting sick just thinking about it.Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.16,0:25:57.86,Main,,0,0,0,,–What the hell are you talking about?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.16,0:26:01.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I promised Hancock that I wouldn't cause an uproar here,Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.92,0:26:03.42,Main,,0,0,0,,but you got me dragged into this!Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.42,0:26:05.75,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not like I wanted you to get involved!Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.96,0:26:20.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I just got foiled in "Buggy's Great Jail-Break Plan"!Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.06,0:26:21.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Who gives a damn?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.40,0:26:26.32,Main,,0,0,0,,They're coming from the front, too!Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.32,0:26:28.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it!Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.28,0:26:30.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Why are you escaping, anyway?Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.57,0:26:33.49,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you talkin' about, stupid?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.49,0:26:36.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't know the kinds of torture they put me through!Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.83,0:26:40.07,Main,,0,0,0,,These guys are cold-blooded monsters!Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.07,0:26:42.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Then you just have to avoid getting caught, right?Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.04,0:26:43.88,Main,,0,0,0,,W-W-What are you talking about?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.88,0:26:45.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.71,0:26:48.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I guess I've already caused an uproar.Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.17,0:26:55.05,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the thing I can't stand about you and that Red-Hair...Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.05,0:26:59.41,Main,,0,0,0,,You're always thinking positively, but in a bad way.Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.89,0:27:05.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Fine. Let's do this!Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.95,0:27:07.82,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to do it, won't 